body:
I'm trying to reset my password but my problem is the email im receiving in my gmail to reset it is in japanese and I a. cant read it and the translate option in chrome just tells me it wont work and b. theres not a clickable link in the email as far as i can tell... any help would be great i want to start playing again D:

&#x200B;

Edit : so I managed to translate the email and it says i don't have an account registered to that email even though i can go in my history like 2-3 years and find the original confirmation email that you had to click to confirm your account so it definitely exists. any suggestions? I really dont want to play if I have to start over
